            "review_title": "Review at Nhà Bè Khánh Hào",
            "review_text": "Dreamer11250475901\n6 contributions\n1\nRainy season in Rach Vem\nJun 2026 • Family\nMy family came here during the rainy season, it is indeed deserted, but this atmosphere I will never forget, the weather is cool because there was a light rain that morning, the water is crystal clear. The aunties and older women were going to scoop something, and when I got close, I saw they were scooping up dried shrimp. So happy, this time, these people, I will truly remember forever\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten September 30, 2026\nNhà Bè Khánh Hào\nCảm ơn bạn và gia đình đã ghé chơi rồi chia sẻ những dòng này. Đọc tới đoạn bạn kể xem mấy cô vớt ruốc, bên mình cũng thấy vui. Mùa mưa có hơi vắng, nhưng mừng là cả nhà vẫn có những kỷ niệm đẹp ở đây. Có dịp quay lại Rạch Vẹm, cả nhà ghé nhà bè nữa nhé.\nThank you for visiting with your family and sharing these memories. It made us smile to read about you watching the local women catching tiny shrimp. It’s a little quieter during the rainy season, so we’re glad your family still had such a lovely time here. We’d be happy to welcome you all back next time you’re in Rach Vem.\nRead more\nWritten September 30, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
