            "review_text": "Explorer39314498295\n6 contributions\n0\nA wonderful place to escape the city\nFeb 2026 • Family\nI stopped for lunch while visiting Rach Vem. Sitting on a raft with a cool breeze, eating while looking out at the sea is quite nice. Going with family or a few friends is suitable.\nI stopped here for lunch while visiting Rach Vem. There was a nice breeze, and I enjoyed looking out at the sea while eating. A good spot to visit with family or a few friends.\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten September 30, 2026\nNhà Bè Khánh Hào\nCảm ơn bạn đã ghé nhà bè ăn trưa nhé. Nghe bạn thích ngồi hóng gió, ngắm biển ở đây, bên mình vui lắm. Lần sau có dịp về Rạch Vẹm, bạn ghé chơi nữa nha.\nThanks for stopping by for lunch! We’re happy you enjoyed the sea breeze and the view from the restaurant. Come by again next time you’re in Rach Vem. We’d love to see you!\nRead more\nWritten September 30, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
